{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Elevator Pitch</i> is a satirical narrative game set in the cold, fluorescent-lit world of corporate absurdity. You play as an eager employee with one mission: deliver your pitch to the boss during a short elevator ride\u2014and survive the encounter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you rise through the building, you'll face increasingly intense (and unreasonably muscular) executives, rival coworkers, and strange office politics. Navigate branching dialogue, make choices that shape your fate, and develop your character\u2019s professional edge with each pitch. The loop is simple: ride, pitch, adapt\u2014but every floor introduces new surprises.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3891130?t=1759156413","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891130/cf42b489daa6c4c4ee20dbb437495a8067d2cd31/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759156413","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891130/c3a28628eb3fd89f395fcfa39258e9d626dbccfb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759156413","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891130/c3a28628eb3fd89f395fcfa39258e9d626dbccfb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759156413","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Elevator Pitch</i> is a satirical narrative game set in the cold, fluorescent-lit world of corporate absurdity. You play as an eager employee with one mission: deliver your pitch to the boss during a short elevator ride\u2014and survive the encounter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you rise through the building, you'll face increasingly intense (an